==Notes==
*Creatures may not simultaneously use a shield and a [[two-handed weapon]].
*[[Tower shield]]s additionally require that the wielder be [[size modifier|medium-sized]] or larger. (In particular, [[gnome]]s and [[halfling]]s may not use tower shields, even with this feat.)

